cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "cliffvm"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Dmitrii O."
    family-names: "Chechetkin"
repository-code: "https://github.com/chedim/cliffvm"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  cliffvm is the cliffhanger VM: a reactive graph of entities with getters and
  setters, a SQLite store, an HTTP door and drivers. It is the engine of babyseat,
  an AI seat whose memory is a graph the model programs; the behaviour is written
  in c1f packs and the engine is only the host.
keywords:
  - virtual machine
  - reactive graph
  - entity graph
  - memory
  - LLM
